  step,dige:4d8d5b4a1abafbd1
  step=2,desc:seed the orchestra — a stuffed band beside three kin songs and two loose strays,dige:d516aa5f8f793f5e
  step=3,desc:commission the glass foam-cut and nested — six top cells with the band carrying three,dige:9d653dccb345c38e
  step=4,desc:read the weave — flow among the kin songs and none touching the strays,dige:273be0d36aabc6f8
  step=5,desc:give two songs a shared mood — the weave must deepen live,dige:8f4ac83722ee3aae
  step=6,desc:focus one song — its cell must swell while an off-focus sibling compresses,dige:fcfc2bc9fa471ba2
  step=7,desc:re-pose the commission — drop a stray and admit a pull,dige:6e84329fdb0df98b
  step=8,desc:drop the drummer — the escort marks one stir then the row leaves the bag,dige:32ea0b3b607a0498
